/ "highest first", in words, builds to list.query with order desc (plain order is ascending — #18).
Start
- set %players% = [{name: "a", score: 10}, {name: "b", score: 30}, {name: "c", score: 20}]
- order %players% by score, highest first, write to %ranked%
- assert that %ranked[0].name% is "b"
- assert that %ranked[2].name% is "a"
